🇷🇺 🕊️🇺🇦 TASS: Ukraine refused a temporary ceasefire to collect the bodies of dead Ukrainian Armed Forces soldiers in Konstantinovka.

🟠Reminder - "The Russian Defense Ministry made a statement proposing a humanitarian action to collect and hand over the bodies of dead Ukrainian Armed Forces soldiers after gaining full control over Konstantinovka;

➡️Ukraine refused to participate in the humanitarian action to hand over the bodies of dead Ukrainian Armed Forces soldiers in Konstantinovka;

➡️Kiev did nothing to ensure that the bodies of dead Ukrainian Armed Forces soldiers were properly buried by their relatives;

➡️The Ukrainian authorities once again demonstrated their attitude towards dead servicemen as expendable resources." (TASS) 

➡️Maria Zakharova commented the Ukrainian refusal to temporarily stop the fighting in Konstantinovka to the Zvezda TV channel saying:

"Ukrainians don't need Zelensky — neither dead nor alive." 

